    "lines": [
      "I'll give you 2nd quest.",
      "You need to fight Fury that I will summon.",
      "",
      "Too bad, it's not the Fury that is sealed in Cursed ",
      "Temple. It just an illusion made by my willpower.",
      "However it is more powerful and defensive than",
      "any other normal monsters so you better look sharp! ",
      "",
